# 013 audit remediation (P-02): `.config/rtk/filters.toml` is a USER-GLOBAL rtk template that got
# written into the project directory, where rtk never reads it (it reads ~/.config/rtk/). It is
# inert debris — comments and `schema_version` only, no actual filters. Ignored rather than deleted;
# delete it by hand if you want it gone.
.config/

